OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOvernight heavy rain will
OL,6,Fcontinue at first, clearing away
OL,7,Feastwards through the morning with
OL,8,Fisolated showers following. Showers
OL,9,Fdeveloping more widely through the
OL,10,Fday, often heavy with a risk of
OL,11,Fthunder in places. Temperatures around
OL,12,Fnormal.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FShowers easing off with some
OL,15,Flate evening sunshine possible.
OL,16,FOccasional clear spells overnight with
OL,17,Fmostly light winds. Feeling mild for
OL,18,Fmany.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
